{"id":"c701516ccadd54fe","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-projection-game.md","title":"投影约束与二部投影博弈","display":"df-projection-game — 投影约束与二部投影博弈","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-projection-game","aliases":["28-df-projection-game"],"display":"df-projection-game — 投影约束与二部投影博弈","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§22.3 projection property","source_printed_pages":"473","source_pdf_pages":"499","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-projection-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-projection-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-game — 投影约束与二部投影博弈"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§22.3 projection property"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"473"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"499"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V,E\">\\(U,V,E\\)</span> 为有限集合且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(E\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:E\\to U\">\\(s:E\\to U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:E\\to V\">\\(t:E\\to V\\)</span>；每条边 e 给定约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。左右顶点是互不混淆的两个副本。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_{e\\in E})\">\\(\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_{e\\in E})\\)</span> 是本项的二部约束元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:U\\to[W]\">\\(a:U\\to[W]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:V\\to[W]\">\\(b:V\\to[W]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bi}\">\\(\\mathrm{bi}\\)</span> 标识本项的二部赋值值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in[W]\\;\\exists!v\\in[W]\\quad P_e(u,v)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in[W]\\;\\exists!v\\in[W]\\quad P_e(u,v)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjGame}(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProjGame}(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_e(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in[W]\\;(P_e(u,v)=1)\\quad(e\\in E,\\ u\\in[W],\\ \\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^U,\\ b\\in[W]^V}\\frac1{|E|}\\sum_{e\\in E}P_e(a(s(e)),b(t(e))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_e(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in[W]\\;(P_e(u,v)=1)\\quad(e\\in E,\\ u\\in[W],\\ \\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^U,\\ b\\in[W]^V}\\frac1{|E|}\\sum_{e\\in E}P_e(a(s(e)),b(t(e))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>投影是每个左标签有唯一右标签；不要求反向唯一，因此不是 unique game。h_e 的存在唯一性直接来自投影谓词；最大值在有限非空赋值集中取得。本项给并行重复使用的二部语义，不将单份变量的任意非二部 CSP 值不加解释地替换为博弈值。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§22.3 projection property；印刷页 473；PDF 页 499。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V,E","display":false},{"tex":"E\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"s:E\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"t:E\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_{e\\in E})","display":false},{"tex":"a:U\\to[W]","display":false},{"tex":"b:V\\to[W]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in[W]\\;\\exists!v\\in[W]\\quad P_e(u,v)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjGame}(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;\\operatorname{Projection}(P_e).","display":true},{"tex":"h_e(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in[W]\\;(P_e(u,v)=1)\\quad(e\\in E,\\ u\\in[W],\\ \\operatorname{Projection}(P_e)),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^U,\\ b\\in[W]^V}\\frac1{|E|}\\sum_{e\\in E}P_e(a(s(e)),b(t(e))).","display":true}],"bytes":1869,"backlinks":[{"id":"14d1529c46c2f8f2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)$ 为 [[28-df-projection-game]] 的有限二部约束数据，不要求投影性；$W,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，原约束统一为 $P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$。重复的左右整数标签字母表为 $[W^k]$，通过下式双射 $\\beta_k:[W]^k\\to[W^k]$ 编码元组标签，$\\operatorname{dec}_k$ 为其逆；新顶点集合 $U^k,V^k$，边集合 $E^k$。$\\vec e\\in E^k$，$\\vec u,\\vec v\\in[W]^k$，$a,b\\in[W^k]$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-399","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}